ARM64 execution runtime: Unicorn.js by Alexandro Sanchez Bach and the
Unicorn/QEMU contributors, GNU GPL version 2.
Source: https://github.com/AlexAltea/unicorn.js/tree/560284c59c11c8d6c94d537f4354339f069ddcdf
The pinned ARM64-only release, output hashes, and Emscripten version are
identified in runtime.lock.json. tools/build_runtime.py contains the exact
interpreter assertion, spill-storage, and helper-temporary corrections.
tools/prepare_runtime.mjs adds a live JavaScript heap getter; embedded WASM
remains unchanged. The release includes its build metadata and GPL license. This project's
TypeScript source and build scripts are available in the same repository.
